  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "にちかは悔しがっていたよ\r\nもっといい表情にしたかったって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040030,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "ううん\r\nすごく、いい写真だと思う",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もいい写真だと思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "たしかに、にちかは緊張してるように見えるけど\r\nそれも含めて思い出になるはずだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この自然なぎこちなさというか……\r\nシーズに依頼した先方の狙いは、これだったのかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040040,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうなのかな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040050,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……難しいね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040060,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "写真、ちゃんと見てもいい？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040070,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1_s",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040080,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "みーちゃんって呼ばれたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうなのか\r\nはは、だからにちかは、こんなぎこちない笑い方に……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "昔からの友だちのように近い距離感──だったよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "呼び方は、みーちゃん以外でもよかったんじゃないか？\r\n美琴ちゃん、とか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040090,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "そうだったのかもしれないね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040100,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "でも、全然、おかしくなかった",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040110,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……やっぱり、完璧じゃないけど\r\nいい写真だね",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "見るたびに思い出してしまいそう……って\r\nにちかも言ってたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040120,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "みーちゃんって呼んだこと？",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだと思う\r\n恥ずかしいんじゃないか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040130,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "……特別なことじゃないのにね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040140,
    "speaker": "美琴",
    "text": "これからも\r\nたまに呼んでくれればいいのに",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile1",
    "charLabel": "mikoto",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/302502204/3025022040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 3025022040150,
